  "title": "Quietly Grassy Ethiopian Turnips Berbere Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful Ethiopian stew made with turnips and berbere spice, perfect for a post-workout meal. This dish is shojin-friendly and features a grassy and chewy texture.",
